-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mendes</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Linking the genes: inferring quantitative gene networks from microarray data</article-title><source>Trends Genet</source><year>2002</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>395</fpage><lpage>398</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12142007</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0168-9525(02)02692-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gardner</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name><name><surname>di Bernardo</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lorenz</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Collins</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inferring genetic networks and identifying compound mode of action via expression profiling</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2003</year><volume>301</volume><fpage>102</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12843395</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1081900</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friedman</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Linial</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nachman</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Pe'er</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Using bayesian networks to analyze expression data</article-title><source>Journal Comput Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>601</fpage><lpage>620</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11108481</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/106652700750050961</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friedman</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person